{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-12-15 06:20:00', 'title': "LINDE RECEIVES 'A' FOR WATER STEWARDSHIP FROM CDP", 'text': "GUILFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / DECEMBER 15, 2021 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED AN 'A' FROM CDP FOR ITS APPROACH TO TACKLING WATER SECURITY. IT IS ONE OF ONLY A SELECT GROUP OF GLOBAL COMPANIES TO ACHIEVE THE TOP SCORE."}